            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 131072,
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "rasterItems": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 131072,
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "textItems": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 131072,
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Bounded structural DTO shell only. Optional rasterItems/textItems carry the cell's raster images and text blocks (entries target+item / target+block, strict native decoding, asset and mesh references stay valid only in the source document; a paste into another document or with an unresolved reference refuses typed). They count toward the same 4MiB data bound. Native strict decoding validates full record/order grammar, offsets, key/record and version/order relationships atomically; no record/order data is dropped. Records/order arrays use nativeDataBytes/32=131072 entries to avoid rejecting native-valid packets above4096 objects; cell/selection counts stay4096 and aggregate native data bytes remain4MiB."
      }
    },
